          <Layout class="org.netbeans.modules.form.compat2.layouts.support.JScrollPaneSupportLayout"/>
          <SubComponents>
            <Component class="javax.swing.JTextArea" name="jTextArea1">
              <Properties>
                <Property name="background" type="java.awt.Color" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.ColorEditor">
                  <Color blue="cc" green="cc" red="cc" type="rgb"/>
                </Property>
                <Property name="columns" type="int" value="20"/>
                <Property name="font" type="java.awt.Font" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.FontEditor">
                  <Font name="Segoe UI" size="10" style="1"/>
                </Property>
                <Property name="rows" type="int" value="5"/>
                <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="(Cool Facts About Sea Turtles)&#xa;&#xa;1)Sea turtles have existed for over 100 million years.&#xa;&#xa;2)Some species migrate thousands of miles across&#xa; oceans every year.&#xa;&#xa;3)They can hold their breath for up to 7 hours&#xa; while resting.&#xa;&#xa;4)Female turtles return to the exact beach they&#xa; were born on to lay eggs &#x2014; sometimes after&#xa; decades.&#xa;&#xa;(How Sea Pollution Affects Sea Turtles)&#xa;&#xa;1)Turtles often mistake plastic bags and balloons&#xa; for jellyfish, their favourite food, causing choking&#xa; or starvation.&#xa;&#xa;2)Oil spills coat their shells, making movement,&#xa; buoyancy, and temperature regulation difficult.&#xa;&#xa;3)Pollution weakens the seagrass and coral &#xa;ecosystems turtles depend on.&#xa;&#xa;4)Entanglement in plastic rings, nets, or fishing line&#xa; injures or traps turtles, often fatally.&#xa;&#xa;5)Polluted beaches make it harder for hatchlings to&#xa; reach the sea safely.&#xa;"/>
              </Properties>
            </Component>
          </SubComponents>
        </Container>
      </SubComponents>
